4 billion, up 12.2% from $1.2 billion in the three months ended 2025-10-03.","cites":["GEN.d.revenue.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","GEN.d.revenue.2025-07-05.2025-10-03"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-10-02 revenue added up to $5.2 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $2.2 billion and net income to $1.2 billion.","cites":["GEN.d.revenue.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","GEN.d.revenue.2025-03-29.2026-04-03","GEN.d.revenue.2025-03-29.2026-01-02","GEN.d.revenue.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","GEN.d.revenue.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","GEN.d.opinc.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","GEN.d.opinc.2025-03-29.2026-04-03","GEN.d.opinc.2025-03-29.2026-01-02","GEN.d.opinc.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","GEN.d.opinc.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","GEN.d.netinc.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","GEN.d.netinc.2025-03-29.2026-04-03","GEN.d.netinc.2025-03-29.2026-01-02","GEN.d.netinc.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","GEN.d.netinc.2026-07-04.2026-10-02"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $1.8 billion: operating cash flow of $1.8 billion less capital spending of $16 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["GEN.d.ocf.2025-03-29.2026-01-02","GEN.d.ocf.2025-03-29.2025-10-03","GEN.d.ocf.2025-03-29.2026-04-03","GEN.d.ocf.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","GEN.d.ocf.2026-04-04.2026-10-02","GEN.d.capex.2025-03-29.2026-01-02","GEN.d.capex.2025-03-29.2025-10-03","GEN.d.capex.2025-03-29.2026-04-03","GEN.d.capex.2026-04-04.2026-07-03","GEN.d.capex.2026-04-04.2026-10-02"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-07-28 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2026 as $83.6 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $33.5 million.","cites":["GEN.pay.peoTotal.2026","GEN.pay.peoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $22.2 million in total and $8.3 million actually paid.","cites":["GEN.pay.neoTotal.2026","GEN.pay.neoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $98.00 at the end of FY2026, and $230.00 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["GEN.pay.tsr.2026","GEN.pay.peerTsr.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $1.3 billion at the end of FY2026, against $1.3 billion a year earlier. That is 26.4% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["GEN.rpo.2026","GEN.rpo.2025","GEN.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $1.9 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiabilityCurrent), against $1.8 billion a year earlier.","cites":["GEN.deferred.2026","GEN.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 3,900 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $1.3 million for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["GEN.q.employees","GEN.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2026 annual report tags restructuring charges of $35 million, after $7 million in FY2025.","cites":["GEN.restructuring.2026","GEN.restructuring.2025"]}]},"fin":{"GEN":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":34,"read":34,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["DERSE NATALIE MARIE","CFO"],["Witteveen Travis Michael","Head of Products and Portfolio"],["KO BRYAN SEUK","COO, CLO and Secretary"],["Vlcek Ondrej","Director"],["Chrystal John C","Director"]],"rows":[["S",0,72341,2204208.57,"2026-11-18","2026-11-18","0000849399-26-000087","2026-11-20",0],["S",1,30000,892422,"2026-11-02","2026-11-02","0000849399-26-000085","2026-11-04",0],["S",2,28248,866450.9,"2026-09-04","2026-09-04","0000849399-26-000050","2026-09-09",1],["S",3,200000,6000000,"2026-08-27","2026-08-27","0000849399-26-000046","2026-08-28",0],["S",3,152358,4418397.24,"2